For example, I would put `cy.visit('auth/login?next=page_I_Want')` it goes to the login page, logs in, then I get this newUrl message with the following `https://qa.app.com/__/page_I_want`, and then it immediately stops and gives me another newUrl and it is our home page. 

I tried the suggestions for #992 and it does not work. 

